00:34:10.120 --> 00:34:12.460
Are you interested in
infantry, transportation?"

00:34:12.460 --> 00:34:14.540
And he was like, "Transportation.

00:34:14.540 --> 00:34:15.470
I grew up on a farm.

00:34:15.470 --> 00:34:16.720
I drive all types of things.

00:34:16.720 --> 00:34:18.397
I'll do transportation."

00:34:19.440 --> 00:34:21.710
And so he tells the story,

00:34:21.710 --> 00:34:25.930
I'm not gonna read it of,
like everybody in the,

00:34:25.930 --> 00:34:28.700
I'm sorry, I don't know the actual term,

00:34:28.700 --> 00:34:30.410
the group of 80 people-
Platoon?

00:34:30.410 --> 00:34:33.290
That are being put through basic training

00:34:33.290 --> 00:34:35.030
