00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:36.890
The vast majority of people,

00:34:36.890 --> 00:34:39.373
when they got their
assignment, it was Vietnam,

00:34:40.340 --> 00:34:45.340
but his was Washington DC.

00:34:45.570 --> 00:34:48.040
And he was like, there
must be some mistake.

00:34:48.040 --> 00:34:52.660
Two people out of all 80,
it says Washington DC.

00:34:52.660 --> 00:34:53.957
And he goes up there and the guy says,

00:34:53.957 --> 00:34:55.620
"Well, you lucky duck.

00:34:55.620 --> 00:34:59.030
You've been assigned to be a chauffeur

00:34:59.030 --> 00:35:03.317
