00:35:03.317 --> 00:35:04.150
Whoa.

00:35:04.150 --> 00:35:06.593
Talk about dodging a bullet, or many.

00:35:07.580 --> 00:35:11.010
It's like, he was, and it was kind of,

00:35:11.010 --> 00:35:13.170
he was very fortunate.

00:35:13.170 --> 00:35:15.940
And then he tells the
story of learning to drive

00:35:15.940 --> 00:35:18.130
every piece of equipment in the army,

00:35:18.130 --> 00:35:19.889
including tanks and
stuff, but then he was,

00:35:19.889 --> 00:35:23.110
when he got his assignment
to go to the Pentagon,

00:35:23.110 --> 00:35:27.490
he was driving senators and
all government officials

00:35:27.490 --> 00:35:30.130
