00:37:59.397 --> 00:38:03.283
"1976, bothered by pollen.

00:38:05.040 --> 00:38:08.520
From the mid-'70s, I was
always bothered by pollen.

00:38:08.520 --> 00:38:12.210
My eyes would always turn
red and itch very bad.

00:38:12.210 --> 00:38:15.250
I had to use many bottles of Visine.

00:38:15.250 --> 00:38:16.700
Visine would just ease it off

00:38:16.700 --> 00:38:19.090
for a few minutes, but not long.

00:38:19.090 --> 00:38:20.960
During the '70s and '80s,

00:38:20.960 --> 00:38:23.293
I had to wear a mask
while mowing the grass.

00:38:24.140 --> 00:38:27.550
In the earlier '90s, after my divorce,

00:38:27.550 --> 00:38:30.090
pollen bothered me for one year.

00:38:30.090 --> 00:38:34.480
It is now 2016, and it has
not bothered me in 15 years.

00:38:34.480 --> 00:38:36.300
Thank you, Lord.

00:38:36.300 --> 00:38:37.820
I have not had any treatment

00:38:37.820 --> 00:38:40.130
and do not take any meds for it.

00:38:40.130 --> 00:38:42.520
It just does not bother me anymore."

00:38:42.520 --> 00:38:43.753
Man, that's awesome.

00:38:43.753 --> 00:38:46.400
I know, it's like-
Bothered by pollen.

00:38:46.400 --> 00:38:51.400
Yeah, he was like, this is just a strange,

00:38:51.610 --> 00:38:53.560
this is his way of saying,

00:38:53.560 --> 00:38:57.370
this is an inexplicable,
